{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Bringing Home the Bacon", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals <span class=\"italic\">ought to, may</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to give advice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You can also use the expressions <span class=\"italic\">It would be a good idea to ... , You had better ... </span>or <span class=\"italic\">You might want to  ... </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> are used for giving strong advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the food over there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Our manager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ought to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inform us\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"about deliveries.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"may\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"want\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to place another order.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Our manager ought to inform us about deliveries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You could put the food over there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You may want to place another order. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI wish ... \u201d</span> to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The verb <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. After <span class=\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I wish I knew ... <br/>I wish I had ... <br/>I wish you were ... ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/>Wish + Simple Past tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish they put signs on back doors.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want them to put signs on back doors, but they don't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish our manager told us things like this.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want our manager to tell us things like this, but she doesn't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I worked somewhere else.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to work somewhere else, but I don't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get by", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to manage or succeed in doing something with difficulty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We barely have enough eggs to get by.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to carry on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to keep going", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Please carry on with what you are doing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "delivery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the action of bringing food or other items to where they are needed, such as a house or restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've got a large food delivery to drop off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "folk", "type": "name"}, {"content": "people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Nice to come across some nice folk once in a while.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bring home the bacon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to earn money to support the costs of living for the family, like food or rent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Everyone has to bring home the bacon!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Look at the 5 expressions related to food in the box below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, guess what each expression means.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online to verify your answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find 2 - 3 more expressions related to food in English. Find their meanings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 sentences that include your favorite expressions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner or to the class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"There's no use crying over spilled milk.<br/> Go bananas.<br/> Don't spill the beans.<br/> It's the icing on the cake.<br/> He's the big cheese.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I discuss the meanings of expressions in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I find 2 - 3 more expressions and their meanings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write sentences using expressions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:  Hello mate!  Is this the back door of Bistro 88? I wish they put signs on back doors. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Yes, it is. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Great, I've got a large food delivery to drop off. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  I didn't know we were expecting a delivery today. I wish our manager told us things like this. She ought to inform us about deliveries. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Well, you see here?  I have it on my delivery schedule. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  OK, carry on then. You could take the food over there."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "27500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:   I've got milk, cheese, bacon and coffee. I guess it's for breakfast. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Do you have eggs? We barely have enough eggs to get by. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Yup, I've got 20 cartons of eggs. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  What about butter? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: No, no butter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I wish you had butter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: You may want to place another order."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "48000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  OK. I'm Tom, by the way. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:  Pleased to meet you, Tom. Harald here. Nice to come across some nice folk once in awhile. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Oh, everyone at Bistro 88 is quite nice, except maybe our manager Vanessa. She's a tough one to figure out.  We have to deal with some interesting situations, I can tell you that. I wish I worked somewhere else. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Well, everyone has to bring home the bacon, my good boy!"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write  about what is advisable.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  In your opinion, who usually makes money for the family: a man, a woman or both?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Who usually makes more money: younger people or older people? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you think it is the same situatio